      "id": "claim_2487d0dc7ee34a76bb481bbe316dbf25",
      "statement": "Folder removal uses a two-step confirmation protocol: an unconfirmed request only reports whether active coordinator work or stored sync work exists, and the frontend shows the corresponding warning before retrying with confirmation. The confirmed backend operation unwatches before cancelling and discarding path-scoped sync state, and it attempts watcher reconciliation if cleanup or folder deletion fails.",
